\f0\b\fs36 \cf0 \strokec2 3. Image Resolution Strategy\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa280\partightenfactor0

\fs28 \cf0 3.1 Training Resolution: 640\'d7640\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 All images were trained at a resolution of 
\f0\b 640\'d7640 pixels
\f1\b0 .\
This choice was motivated by:\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\ls4\ilvl0\cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 compatibility with YOLOv8\'92s default architecture,\
\ls4\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 GPU memory efficiency,\
\ls4\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 and the fact that CubiCasa images are naturally close to this scale.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\cf0 Importantly, 
\f0\b no resizing to 1024\'d71024
\f1\b0  was performed at this stage.\uc0\u8232 Higher-resolution training is postponed to the fine-tuning phase, where domain-specific details become more relevant.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf3 \strokec3 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs36 \cf0 \strokec2 4. Model Architecture\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa280\partightenfactor0

\fs28 \cf0 4.1 YOLOv8 Medium (YOLOv8m)\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 The 
\f0\b YOLOv8m
\f1\b0  architecture was selected.\
Reasons for this choice:\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\ls5\ilvl0\cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 sufficient capacity to model thin walls and elongated structures,\
\ls5\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 better localization performance than YOLOv8n/s,\
\ls5\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 still efficient enough for large-scale inference using tiling.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\cf0 The model was initialized from 
\f0\b pretrained COCO weights
\f1\b0 , enabling faster convergence and better generalization.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf3 \strokec3 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\partightenfactor0

