\f0\b\fs36 \cf0 \strokec2 6. Training Process\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa280\partightenfactor0

\fs28 \cf0 6.1 Initial Training\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 The model was first trained for 
\f0\b 100 epochs
\f1\b0  on the CubiCasa dataset at 640\'d7640 resolution.\
During this phase:\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\ls7\ilvl0\cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 losses decreased steadily,\
\ls7\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 validation metrics converged early,\
\ls7\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 and the model achieved stable performance.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa280\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs28 \cf0 6.2 Extended Training (Continuation)\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 After the initial 100 epochs, training was continued for additional epochs using the last checkpoint (
\f2\fs26 last.pt
\f1\fs24 ) as initialization.\
This continuation aimed to:\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\ls8\ilvl0\cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 slightly refine detection quality,\
\ls8\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 reduce variance in wall detection,\
\ls8\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 and confirm that performance had plateaued.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\cf0 Early stopping was enabled, and training stopped automatically once no further improvements were observed.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf3 \strokec3 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\partightenfactor0

