\f0\b\fs36 \cf0 \strokec2 9. Role in the Overall Pipeline\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 At this stage, the model is used for:\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\ls11\ilvl0\cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 tiled inference on large floor plan images,\
\ls11\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 generation of wall/opening masks,\
\ls11\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 and as input to geometric post-processing steps (wall closing, room detection).\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\cf0 No room detection is learned directly by the network.\uc0\u8232 Instead, 
\f0\b rooms are inferred geometrically
\f1\b0  from detected walls and openings.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
