\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 While effective on CubiCasa data, this model:\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\ls12\ilvl0\cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 has not yet seen German architectural drawing conventions,\
\ls12\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 was trained only at 640\'d7640 resolution,\
\ls12\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 and does not explicitly handle domain-specific symbols or styles.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\cf0 These limitations motivate the 
\f0\b next stage: fine-tuning on German floor plans
\f1\b0 , which will adapt the learned representations to the target domain.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf3 \strokec3 \
